057500*******************************************************
057600**   CALL 'CBLOWSRT' FIRST BEFORE GOING INTO THE
057700**   SORT VERB.  THE FIRST CALL TO 'CBLOWSRT' OPENS
057800**   UP A NEW TEMPORARY FILE 'BLUPDATA' THAT IS USED
057900**   TO WRITE THE BLOWUP INFORMATION IF A BLOWUP
058000**   OCCURS
058100*******************************************************
058200
058300     CALL "CBLOWSRT" USING CBLOWSRT-PARMS,
