061800     MOVE SPACES TO BU-DISPLAY-AREA.
           PERFORM 9999-OPEN-STUFF.
063800     MOVE SPACES TO SORT-REC.
063900     MOVE 0 TO SORT-VALUE
064000               SORT-STD-VALUE
064100               SORT-QTY-CHGD.
064200     PERFORM 620-GET-STR-DEPT.
           PERFORM 9999-INIT-DTRANS-MC-I.
064300     PERFORM 400-GET-DTRANS.
064400
064500
064600 200-PROCESS-DETAIL.
064700     IF TRANS-DOCUMENT-NUM = "PROC"
064800         NEXT SENTENCE
064900     ELSE
065000         IF TRANS-CODE-TRANS = "ISS"
065200             PERFORM 500-GET-MMATL-ACCUM
065300             PERFORM 510-GET-LEDGER
065400             PERFORM 520-GET-DESCR
065500             PERFORM 550-GET-MSTORERM
065600             PERFORM 600-BUILD-SORT-REC
065700         ELSE
