           PERFORM 9999-DBGET2-DTRANS-MC-I.
068800     IF GOOD-CALL
068900         NEXT SENTENCE
069000     ELSE
069100         IF END-OF-FILE
069200             NEXT SENTENCE
069300         ELSE
