069500                  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
069600             PERFORM 990-BLOWUP.
069700     MOVE TRANS-STORES-CODE TO MMATL-CODE-ARG.
069800
069900
070000
070100
070200 500-GET-MMATL-ACCUM.
070300     IF MMATL-CODE-ARG = "NON-STR"
070400         PERFORM 505-SET-REPORT-CODE
070500     ELSE
               PERFORM 9999-DBGET7-MMATL-ACCUM-MC-I
071300         IF GOOD-CALL
071400             IF TRANS-ACCT > "009999"
071500                 IF TRANS-CODE = "INV"
071600                     MOVE 06 TO SORT-REPORT-CODE
071700                 ELSE
071800                     MOVE 04 TO SORT-REPORT-CODE
071900             ELSE
072000                 MOVE MATL-REPORT-CODE TO SORT-REPORT-CODE
072100         ELSE
